---
// Vector search in two small pictures. Left: an embedding turns meaning into a position,
// so a query lands near documents that mean the same thing. Right: an approximate index
// (IVFFlat-style lists) only searches the list nearest the query, so the true nearest
// vector can be missed, which is why recall is worth measuring.
// Two dimensions stand in for the thousand-plus of a real embedding; positions and the
// "resetting your password" / "pasta recipe" titles are illustrative.
// Plain inline SVG with site tokens, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 384;
const dotsL = [
  { x: 215, y: 130, hit: true },
  { x: 232, y: 206, hit: false },
  { x: 378, y: 262, hit: false },
];
const dotsR = [
  [500, 130], [530, 160], [560, 100], [600, 96], [510, 105],
  [740, 100], [800, 150], [770, 170], [840, 110],
  [520, 250], [590, 270], [640, 225],
  [720, 255], [800, 225], [840, 275],
];
---
<figure class="vs">
  <div class="vs-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: an embedding model places the query how do I close my account close to the page cancelling your subscription and far from unrelated pages. Right: an approximate index searches only the list nearest the query, so the truly nearest vector in the next list can be missed.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="vs-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Vector search in two pictures</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tìm kiếm vector qua hai hình</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="model" x={34} y={62} size={26} />
    <text x="58" y="67" class="vs-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Meaning becomes position</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ý nghĩa thành vị trí</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="search" x={474} y={62} size={26} />
    <text x="498" y="67" class="vs-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Approximate: search fewer vectors</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Gần đúng: tìm trong ít vector hơn</tspan>
    </text>

    <g transform="translate(0,16)">
      <rect x="20" y="76" width="420" height="220" rx="4" class="vs-frame" />
      <!-- query to nearest doc -->
      <line x1="110" y1="150" x2="215" y2="130" class="vs-link" />
      <path d="M110,140 L112.5,147 L120,147 L114,151.5 L116,159 L110,154.5 L104,159 L106,151.5 L100,147 L107.5,147 Z" class="vs-star" />
      <text x="30" y="182" class="vs-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>"how do I close my account"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>"làm sao đóng tài khoản"</tspan>
      </text>
      {dotsL.map((d) => (<circle cx={d.x} cy={d.y} r="7" class={d.hit ? 'vs-dot is-hit' : 'vs-dot'} />))}
      <text x="228" y="126" class="vs-lbl is-hit">
        <tspan data-lang-en>"cancelling your subscription"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>"huỷ gói đăng ký"</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="245" y="210" class="vs-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>"resetting your password"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>"đặt lại mật khẩu"</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="366" y="266" class="vs-lbl" text-anchor="end">
        <tspan data-lang-en>"pasta recipe"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>"công thức mì ý"</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="460" y="76" width="420" height="220" rx="4" class="vs-frame" />
      <rect x="470" y="82" width="200" height="106" rx="3" class="vs-list is-hit" />
      <line x1="670" x2="670" y1="82" y2="290" class="vs-cut" />
      <line x1="470" x2="870" y1="188" y2="188" class="vs-cut" />
      {dotsR.map((d) => (<circle cx={d[0]} cy={d[1]} r="4.5" class="vs-dot" />))}
      <circle cx="590" cy="150" r="4.5" class="vs-dot is-hit" />
      <circle cx="590" cy="150" r="10" class="vs-ring is-hit" />
      <text x="590" y="174" text-anchor="middle" class="vs-lbl is-hit">
        <tspan data-lang-en>best found</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>tốt nhất tìm được</tspan>
      </text>
      <circle cx="683" cy="128" r="4.5" class="vs-dot is-miss" />
      <circle cx="683" cy="128" r="10" class="vs-ring is-miss" />
      <text x="697" y="150" class="vs-lbl is-miss">
        <tspan data-lang-en>missed</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bị bỏ sót</tspan>
      </text>
      <path d="M640,100 L642.5,107 L650,107 L644,111.5 L646,119 L640,114.5 L634,119 L636,111.5 L630,107 L637.5,107 Z" class="vs-star" />
      <text x="640" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="vs-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>query</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>câu hỏi</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>

    <text x="20" y="338" class="vs-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two dimensions stand in for the thousand-plus of a real embedding.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều thay cho hơn một nghìn chiều của embedding thật.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="358" class="vs-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Titles other than "cancelling your subscription" are made up.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các tiêu đề khác ngoài "huỷ gói đăng ký" là tự nghĩ ra.</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="460" y="330" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="vs-list is-hit" />
    <text x="482" y="339" class="vs-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the list searched (the one nearest the query)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>danh sách được tìm (gần câu hỏi nhất)</tspan>
    </text>
    <circle cx="467" cy="355" r="6" class="vs-ring is-miss" />
    <text x="482" y="359" class="vs-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>true nearest vector, in a list that was skipped</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>vector gần nhất thật, nằm ở danh sách bị bỏ qua</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Left: similar meaning means close together. Right: looking only in the nearest list is fast, but the best answer can sit just across the line. That is why you measure recall.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trái: ý nghĩa giống nhau thì nằm gần nhau. Phải: chỉ tìm trong danh sách gần nhất thì nhanh, nhưng đáp án tốt nhất có thể nằm ngay bên kia đường kẻ. Vì vậy phải đo recall.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .vs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .vs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .vs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .vs text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .vs .vs-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .vs .vs-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .vs .vs-lbl { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .vs .vs-lbl.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .vs .vs-lbl.is-miss { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .vs .vs-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .vs-frame { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .vs-list { fill: none; stroke: none; }
  .vs-list.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .vs-cut { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .vs-link { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .vs-dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .vs-dot.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .vs-dot.is-miss { fill: var(--red); }
  .vs-ring { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .vs-ring.is-hit { stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .vs-ring.is-miss { stroke: var(--red); }
  .vs-star { fill: var(--text); }
  .vs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
